---
/** Answer / worked solution inside an answer key: <Answer>…</Answer> */
---

<div class="answer"><slot /></div>

<style>
  .answer {
    margin: 0.4em 0 0 2.5em;
    padding: 0.5em 0.8em;
    border-left: 3px solid #0f766e;
    background: #f1f8f7;
    break-inside: avoid;
  }
  .answer > :global(* + *) { margin-top: 0.35em; }
</style>
